{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>במות, תאבד</b> — [that] his hope will perish." "<b>אונים</b> — from און. That is, they hope to do און, or אונים is an adjective, like בושים טובים."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra quotes the phrase בושים טובים, apparently a well-known grammatical example of a plural adjective form; the argument turns on whether אונים is a noun or adjectival form."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:05.098774901Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}